&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hey there! &lt;br&gt;We’re &lt;a href=&quot;https://feverup.com/&quot;&gt;Fever&lt;/a&gt;, the world’s leading tech platform for culture and live entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission? To democratize access to culture and entertainment. With our proprietary cutting-edge technology and data-driven approach, we’re revolutionizing the way people engage with live entertainment. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every month, our platform inspires over 300 million people in +55 countries (and counting) to discover unforgettable experiences while also empowering event creators with our data and technology, helping them scale, innovate, and enhance their events to reach new audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our results? We’ve teamed up with major industry leaders like Netflix, F.C. Barcelona, and Primavera Sound, presented international award-winning experiences, and are backed by several leading global investors! Impressive, right?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve our mission, we are looking for bar-raisers with a hands-on mindset who are eager to help shape the future of entertainment!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to be part of the experience?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now, let’s discuss this role and what you will do to help achieve Fever’s mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As part of the Fever Originals team, you will use data and insights to create one-of-a-kind events and experiences that allow people to have unforgettable moments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you&#39;ll work with&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You will join our office in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Canada &lt;/strong&gt;to work with the teams and directly interact with our partners, providers, and venues. In this role you will help Fever grow its pipeline of original events. To do so, you will interact with all departments of Fever, from Marketing to Operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The team you’re about to join consists of people that are motivated, young, and fun. On top of having multicultural backgrounds, people in the team are all top profiles: McKinsey, Amazon, Google, KKR, Cirque du Soleil, PSG, and Roland Garros.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As a Project Manager within our Scalable team, you will work with your Team Lead to develop, launch and manage your events, from A to Z. Whether that is the &lt;a href=&quot;https://thejazzroomexperience.com/&quot;&gt;Jazz Room&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://balletoflights.com/&quot;&gt;Ballet of Lights&lt;/a&gt;, the &lt;a href=&quot;https://thejuryexperience.com/&quot;&gt;Jury Experience&lt;/a&gt;, or any of our upcoming live experiences , you will define the way to scale these events to all our other markets, working hand-in-hand with other Fever Departments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Be responsible for the planning, execution, and reporting of a portfolio of scalable experiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Own the full delivery cycle across all cities within the portfolio, ensuring each market launches and operates according to brand, quality standards and contractual requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Validate growth plans, pricing, market selection and resource allocation to support company objectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Source, select, negotiate and manage contracts with venues, talent agencies, production vendors and other partners&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain strong relationship that supports smooth operations and favourable terms with all production vendors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with New Ventures, Marketing and Finance to ensure market expansions and ongoing operations align with the broader entreprise strategy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Build production budgets and track all project costs, identifying variances early and resolve them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Protect margins by negotiating competitive rates and cutting nonessential expenses when needed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Handle multiple concurrent tasks and markets, working independently by setting the right priorities based on guidance from your Regional Team Lead&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Anticipate operational risks, flag them early, and implement mitigation steps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Validate that the show experience in each city meets the creative, technical, and operational standards of the IP, working with producers to continuously drive improvements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Provide clear, concise status updates covering budget, timelines, risks and performance, offering practical recommendations where applicable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;3+ years in a project management role overseeing complex projects across multiple markets, ideally within live entertainment, events, or experiential environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Fluency in English is required; French and additional languages are a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong vendor management background including venue negotiation, talent contracting, and production oversight&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage budgets, control costs, and optimise margins across large scale projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfortable working independently with the ability to prioritise high impact tasks and manage several workstreams at once&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Skilled in negotiating favourable commercial terms and maintaining long term partner relationships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Experience working with and leading cross-functional teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Track record of solving operational issues quickly and designing solutions to proactively prevent repeat problems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to assess risks early and build mitigation plans that keep launches and operations on schedule&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong communication and interpersonal skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity and driving clarity in fast moving environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborative and willing to get hands dirty and work on all required events tasks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Passion for live events and production management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You can expect to join a group of diverse, hardworking team players, where a cultural fit is someone willing to stay humble and learn and can work nimbly. We welcome applications with unusual backgrounds with the expectation that the applicant will have acquired hard or soft skills and maturity throughout their experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Attractive salary range consisting of a base and the opportunity to earn extensive bonus; the compensation package is in the range of 70-85k&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Opportunity to have a real impact in a high-growth global category leader&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;40% discount on all Fever events and experiences&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Competitive health benefits package&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Work in the heart of the city, with possible travel across our markets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Home office friendly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Responsibility from day one and professional and personal growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Great work environment with a young, international team of talented people to work with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Hiring Process:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A 30 min video call with one of our Talent Acquisition Managers, to better understand your career plan, assess cultural fit and answer any questions you may have&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A 60 min online test with three topics: logic, analytics and written understanding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A 30 min interview with your future manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A 45 min video call with your future manager, including questions about your profile and a business case presentation (to be prepared in advance)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid ; #LI-Fulltime ; #LI-AC3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering joining Fever. We cannot wait to learn more about you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to learn more about us: &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-US/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-UKI/208389-goldman-sachs-asset-management-leads-227m-investment-in-live-entertainment-tech-startup-fever&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Fever&#39;s Blog&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.eu/2023/02/02/fever-raises-110-million-in-new-round-at-1-8-billion-valuation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tech.Eu&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;TechCrunch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fever is committed to creating an inclusive and diverse workspace where everyone&#39;s background and ideas count. Our main goal is to find the best possible talent regardless of place of birth, racial or ethnic origin, gender, gender identity, religion, opinion, sexual orientation, disability, pregnancy, marital status, age or caring responsibilities. We encourage everyone to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require any kind of accommodation during the selection process please contact our Talent team so we can help you by providing a welcoming and seamless journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to know more about how Fever processes your personal data, click here&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1cIzPP7QJGht5LAGKkRGQP8fxh-Z4Mfph2JhGSvhd8zM/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.y7rpsj7nzave&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Fever - Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

