&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Founded by Abhay Parasnis and backed by Microsoft, GV, Salesforce, Lightspeed, Madrona and Menlo, we’re building category-defining technology at the intersection of creativity and AI with real impact. Join us to help shape the future of enterprise marketing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW31691715 BCX4&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW31691715 BCX4&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW121521605 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW121521605 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW121521605 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;You’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW121521605 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;Normal (Web)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a passionate Staff Product Manager– Design and Intelligence, who can help accelerate our exciting journey. This role will put you in the hot seat to drive cutting-edge innovation for some of the largest enterprise companies in the world. You will imagine and build the future of personalized, AI-driven content creation and marketing at scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Product Manager – Design and Intelligence, you will be responsible for building a solid foundation for intelligent, on-brand content design, and contribute to building an AI-native closed-loop intelligent marketing and content creation platform. You will work closely with cross-functional teams including product, engineering, design, AI/ML, and marketing.&amp;nbsp;We are looking for someone who enjoys the fast-paced startup life, can envision an AI and future-first product roadmap, drive results, is a team player and very customer-oriented.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW4729422 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW4729422 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;aaed607e-c2a3-5841-9fb4-41037bfa0faf|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;paragraph&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;paragraph&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,335559740,&amp;quot;240&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,134233118,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233117,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Normal&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;How&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW4729422 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;You’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW4729422 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Make an Impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with engineering, design and other product teams to&amp;nbsp;build innovative 0 -&amp;gt; 1 solutions&amp;nbsp;for the enterprise marketers and creators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineering to&amp;nbsp;build a foundationally&amp;nbsp;solid AI-native, multi-modal content design engine – that understands brand values, principles and design systems to create / modify / suggest marketing content design.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI-native end-to-end and closed-loop content workflows that drive hyper-personalization, content creation &amp;amp; delivery speed, and massive ROI for enterprise marketing teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering to build a solid platform architecture that can scale across a wide range of enterprise customers and marketing use cases.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to identify product improvement and growth opportunities to prioritize initiatives based on impact and effort.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product managers to build and co-launch new products and features that deliver big impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovate at the cutting-edge of AI possibilities and think ahead of the market.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with our enterprise customers to understand their needs and solve for them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW110283551 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW110283551 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;aaed607e-c2a3-5841-9fb4-41037bfa0faf|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;paragraph&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;paragraph&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,335559740,&amp;quot;240&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,134233118,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233117,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Normal&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;What You Bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW110283551 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW110283551 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master&#39;s degree in engineering, computer science, business or a related field. If you have engineering background/experience and, either experience in or have studied business administration/marketing, you’d be a great fit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7+ years of experience in product management or building products, including experience building AI-native software or application. Experience having defined and shipped a new AI product capability from concept through adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing intuitive and simple UI/UX, a solid eye for detail, and ability to distill complex workflows into simple, intuitive user experiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building scalable platform architecture, and ability to understand and discuss engineering architecture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with experience using data to drive decision-making.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with cross-functional teams including product, engineering, design, and marketing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to collaborate effectively with stakeholders at all levels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills with the ability to prioritize and manage multiple initiatives simultaneously, and to get things done.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Experience working at a high-growth startup or tech company&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Experience working with enterprise customers with high interaction&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Experience building with best-in-class product design principles&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Experience with SQL and data analysis tools such as Excel, Mixpanel, Tableau, or Looker&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
