&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14pxh9o&quot; data-start=&quot;1900&quot; data-end=&quot;1974&quot;&gt;2+ years of line striping or pavement maintenance experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;m1xjzt&quot; data-start=&quot;1975&quot; data-end=&quot;2053&quot;&gt;Ability to lift 50+ pounds and work outdoors in varying weather conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;aiejzp&quot; data-start=&quot;2054&quot; data-end=&quot;2109&quot;&gt;Valid driver’s license with reliable transportation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jd684p&quot; data-start=&quot;2110&quot; data-end=&quot;2189&quot;&gt;Willingness to work flexible hours, including nights and weekends as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xhl5py&quot; data-start=&quot;2190&quot; data-end=&quot;2258&quot;&gt;Strong attention to detail and ability to follow precise layouts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lcazl9&quot; data-start=&quot;2259&quot; data-end=&quot;2304&quot;&gt;Strong work ethic and team-player mindset&lt;/li&gt;
