&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1779&quot; data-end=&quot;1816&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1781&quot; data-end=&quot;1816&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1781&quot; data-end=&quot;1795&quot;&gt;Weekly pay&lt;/strong&gt; via direct deposit&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1817&quot; data-end=&quot;1875&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1819&quot; data-end=&quot;1875&quot;&gt;Employee Assistance Program to support your well-being&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1876&quot; data-end=&quot;1935&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1878&quot; data-end=&quot;1935&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1878&quot; data-end=&quot;1904&quot;&gt;Monday–Friday schedule&lt;/strong&gt; with no weekends or holidays&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1936&quot; data-end=&quot;2045&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1938&quot; data-end=&quot;2045&quot;&gt;Clear career growth and advancement opportunities within a nationally recognized home health organization&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;2047&quot; data-end=&quot;2073&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2051&quot; data-end=&quot;2073&quot;&gt;Take the Next Step&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2074&quot; data-end=&quot;2312&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to advance your nursing career into leadership while making a meaningful impact in home health, we’d love to connect with you. Join BAYADA and be part of a team committed to compassion, excellence, and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2314&quot; data-end=&quot;2375&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2314&quot; data-end=&quot;2367&quot;&gt;Apply today and lead the way in home health care.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;2367&quot; data-end=&quot;2370&quot;&gt;#LIRX&lt;/p&gt;
